# AC semantic probe: turnaround stages and gate (PLAN-796 T-05)

status: not-executed — versioned contract file until D-788 + T-06 (see
infer-bindings.case.ad). The Rust-directed counterpart that DOES run
today: `sema_turnaround_*` in
`experimental/ac-semantics/probe/tests/sema_turnaround_scenarios.rs`,
and the committed raw-samples report
`docs/reports/plan796/turnaround.{md,json}` (regenerated by
`sema-probe bench-turnaround <out-dir> [store-root]`).

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/1"
  id: "ac.sema.turnaround"
  tags: ["ac-semantics", "not-executed-until-D-788"]
  source: { file: "cases/ac-semantics/src/turnaround-ref.at", syntax: "ac-core", path: "turnaround-ref.at", generator: "gen796-1mi/v1" }
  sema: { package: "ref", module: "reference" }
  checks: [
    { id: "stages", adapter: "sema", action: "query",
      query: { kind: "infer-body", fn: "f0" },
      expect: { completion: "success",
        stages_include: ["request", "cache-read-validate", "infer", "publish"] } },
    { id: "hard-gate", adapter: "sema", action: "edit-and-query", samples: 30,
      edit: { kind: "body-literal", fn: "f0" },
      expect: { completion: "success", p95_lt_ms: 1000,
        file: "cases/ac-semantics/oracle/ac.sema.turnaround.gate.json", compare: "json" } },
    { id: "six-scenarios", adapter: "sema", action: "scenario-suite", samples_each: 30,
      scenarios: ["no-op", "local-body-edit", "sig-change", "restart-disk-hot", "cross-project", "gc-concurrent"],
      expect: { completion: "success", keep_raw_samples: true,
        extra_rows: ["full-cold", "wide-invalidation"] } }
  ]
}
```
